Subject: [PATCH] feat(billing): GET /billing/offer gives the pricing page both
 free periods

Frontend TO_BACKEND 21:30Z, Misho's decision tonight: the card trial stays
5 days, and the pricing page shows both numbers, the card trial and the
days an invitation carries. Neither reached the app.

A public, rate-limited read (the page is also seen signed out), mounted
ahead of the signed-in /billing router: { card_trial_days, invite_free_days },
with invite_free_days null while its switch is off. It reads the same
values the grant uses. Contract in docs/FOR_FRONTEND.md.

